atalok, feln\u0151ttek \u00e9s id\u0151sek kih\u00edv\u00e1sokkal \u00e9s akad\u00e1lyokkal szembes\u00fclnek a k\u00f6zleked\u00e9sben, mozg\u00e1sban \u2013 amelyek az adott sz\u00fcks\u00e9gleteikhez \u00e9s k\u00e9pess\u00e9geikhez kapcsol\u00f3dnak.\nAz Eur\u00f3pai Mobilit\u00e1si H\u00e9t arra \u00f6szt\u00f6n\u00f6z minket, hogy olyan mobilit\u00e1st k\u00e9pzelj\u00fcnk el, ahol a k\u00f6zleked\u00e9si rendszerek minden koroszt\u00e1lyhoz igazodnak, \u00e9s kiel\u00e9g\u00edtik a jelenlegi \u00e9s a j\u00f6v\u0151 gener\u00e1ci\u00f3inak ig\u00e9nyeit. A koroszt\u00e1lyok k\u00f6z\u00f6tti egy\u00fcttm\u0171k\u00f6d\u00e9s \u00e9s az egyes gener\u00e1ci\u00f3k k\u00e9szs\u00e9geinek \u00e9s eszk\u00f6zeinek felhaszn\u00e1l\u00e1sa befogad\u00f3bb\u00e1 teheti a mobilit\u00e1st.\nA rendezv\u00e9nysorozat hazai koordin\u00e1tora a K\u00f6zleked\u00e9si \u00e9s Beruh\u00e1z\u00e1si Miniszt\u00e9rium. Friss inform\u00e1ci\u00f3k\u00e9rt k\u00f6vesse az esem\u00e9ny k\u00f6zponti Facebook oldal\u00e1t:\u00a0https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/EMH.AMN\nForr\u00e1s: Szentendre Hivatalos Oldala","format":"plain_text"}],"field_program_end":[{"value":"2026-09-22T15:00:00"}],"field_program_family":[{"value":"0"}],"field_program_image":[{"uri":"https:\/\/programok.szentendre.hu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/744820700_1050523057413369_4709230437870952848_n.jpg","title":"","options":[]}],"field_program_last_seen":[{"value":"2026-08-31T18:18:03"}],"field_program_place":[{"target_id":"1164"}],"field_program_price":[],"field_program_source_updated":[{"value":"2026-07-24T12:10:07"}],"field_program_start":[{"value":"2026-09-16T06:00:00"}],"field_program_status":[{"value":"scheduled"}],"field_program_ticket":[],"field_source_name":[{"value":"Szentendrei Programkeres\u0151"}],"field_source_url":[{"uri":"https:\/\/programok.szentendre.hu\/esemeny\/europai-mobilitasi-het-es-automentes-nap-szentendren\/","title":null,"options":[]}]},{"nid":[{"value":"1168"}],"uuid":[{"value":"3bf6a285-d