0edv\u00e1s a T\u00c9R\u00cdT\u00c9SMENTES SZENTENDREI SZ\u00cdV NAPJA esem\u00e9nyre. Gyakorlati t\u00e9ma: \u00fajra\u00e9leszt\u00e9s \u2013 laikus defibrill\u00e1tor haszn\u00e1lata\nFoglalkoz\u00e1svezt\u0151: Dr Ruzs\u00e1s \u00c9va \u00e9s Dr Husz\u00e1rn\u00e9 K\u00fcrti \u00c9va\nOKT\u00d3BER 14.\nMit \u00e9rdemes tudni a ritmuszavarokr\u00f3l \u00e9s azok legmodernebb eszk\u00f6z\u00f6s kezel\u00e9s\u00e9r\u0151l?\nEl\u0151ad\u00f3: Dr Ruzs\u00e1s \u00c9va \u00e9s megh\u00edvott kardiol\u00f3gus vend\u00e9ge\nAz el\u0151ad\u00e1st k\u00f6vet\u0151en k\u00f6tetlen besz\u00e9lget\u00e9s a szakemberekkel.\nNOVEMBER 18.\nSz\u00edv\u00e1t\u00fcltet\u00e9s \u00e9s a sz\u00edvel\u00e9gtelens\u00e9g eszk\u00f6z\u00f6s \u00e9s m\u0171t\u00e9ti kezel\u00e9se\nEl\u0151ad\u00f3: Dr Ruzs\u00e1s \u00c9va megh\u00edvott vend\u00e9ge PROFESSZOR DR. SZABOLCS ZOLT\u00c1N!\nEl\u0151ad\u00e1s \u00e9s k\u00f6z\u00f6s besz\u00e9lget\u00e9s\nA c\u00e9l az eduk\u00e1ci\u00f3, a figyelemfelkelt\u00e9s a sz\u00edvbetegs\u00e9gek \u00e9s \u00e1ltal\u00e1ban a betegs\u00e9gek megel\u0151z\u00e9s\u00e9re \u00e9s a kezel\u00e9si form\u00e1k megismer\u00e9s\u00e9re!\n\u201eK\u00e9z a k\u00e9zben az orvossal a betegs\u00e9gmegel\u0151z\u00e9s\u00e9rt \u00e9s a sikeres gy\u00f3gyul\u00e1s\u00e9rt!\u201d","format":"plain_text"}],"field_program_end":[{"value":"2026-11-18T18:30:00"}],"field_program_family":[{"value":"0"}],"field_program_image":[{"uri":"https:\/\/programok.szentendre.hu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/784222710_1050783777817856_2386146201914531002_n.jpg","title":"","options":[]}],"field_program_last_seen":[{"value":"2026-08-31T18:18:03"}],"field_program_place":[{"target_id":"1187"}],"field_program_price":[],"field_program_source_updated":[{"value":"2026-08-31T07:21:49"}],"field_program_start":[{"value":"2026-09-16T16:00:00"}],"field_program_status":[{"value":"scheduled"}],"field_program_ticket":[],"field_source_name":[{"value":"Szentendrei Programkeres\u0151"}],"field_source_