,"attributes":{"name":"twitter:image:alt","content":"S\u00e9t\u00e1lj be! \u2013 helyi \u00fczletek \u00e9s term\u00e9kek Szentendr\u00e9n"}}],"path":[{"langcode":"hu"}],"menu_link":[],"field_external_id":[{"value":"18457"}],"field_program_all_day":[{"value":"0"}],"field_program_category":[{"target_id":"121"},{"target_id":"108"},{"target_id":"113"},{"target_id":"120"},{"target_id":"109"}],"field_program_description":[{"value":"Kacsak\u0151 Piac \u2013 Szentendre\nTal\u00e1lkozzunk a Duna-parton!\nSzeptember 6-\u00e1n, vas\u00e1rnap a Kacsak\u0151 Bisztr\u00f3 ad otthont a Kacsak\u0151 Piacnak, ahol gondosan v\u00e1logatott termel\u0151k \u00e9s k\u00e9zm\u0171ves alkot\u00f3k hozz\u00e1k el legjobb term\u00e9keiket Szentendre egyik legszebb helysz\u00edn\u00e9re.\nA piacon mintegy 15 ki\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 v\u00e1rja a l\u00e1togat\u00f3kat pr\u00e9mium min\u0151s\u00e9g\u0171 term\u00e9kekkel: k\u00e9zm\u0171ves \u00e9lelmiszerekkel, k\u00fcl\u00f6nleges finoms\u00e1gokkal, termel\u0151i port\u00e9k\u00e1kkal \u00e9s egyedi alkot\u00e1sokkal.\nHa szereted a min\u0151s\u00e9gi alapanyagokat, a k\u00f6zvetlen termel\u0151i kapcsolatokat \u00e9s a nyugodt dunaparti hangulatot, akkor itt a helyed.\nA v\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00e1s mellett \u00e9rdemes megpihenni a Kacsak\u0151 Bisztr\u00f3 terasz\u00e1n is, ahol finom \u00e9telek, friss italok \u00e9s a Duna panor\u00e1m\u00e1ja teszi teljess\u00e9 a vas\u00e1rnapi kikapcsol\u00f3d\u00e1st.\nMi v\u00e1r r\u00e1d? \u2022 V\u00e1logatott termel\u0151k \u00e9s k\u00e9zm\u0171vesek \u2022 Pr\u00e9mium min\u0151s\u00e9g\u0171 hazai \u00e9s k\u00fcl\u00f6nleges term\u00e9kek \u2022 K\u00f3stol\u00f3k \u00e9s szem\u00e9lyes tal\u00e1lkoz\u00e1sok a k\u00e9sz\u00edt\u0151kkel \u2022 A Kacsak\u0151 Bisztr\u00f3 kiv\u00e1l\u00f3 \u00e9telei \u00e9s italai \u2022 Egy kellemes vas\u00e1rnap Szentendre egyik legszebb dunaparti helysz\u00edn\u00e9n\nId\u0151pont: 2026. szeptember 6. (vas\u00e1rnap), 10:00-15:00 k\u00f6z\u00f6tt\nHelysz\u00edn: Kacsak\u0151 Bisztr\u00f3, Szentendre \u2013 Duna-part\n\u00a0V\u00e1runk szeretettel!\nKacsak\u0151 Piac \u2013 Min\u0151s\u00e9g a Duna partj\u00e1n.\nKi\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3k:\nJ\u00f3 s\u00fcti\nPr\u00e9mium Mangalica \u00e9s m\u00e1s \u00e1llats\u00e1gok\nA Mi Sz\u00f6rp\u00fcnk\nYumma- Tea together\nKalapos Gomba\nKal\u00e1szi Kov\u00e1szda\nLehoczki M\u00e9h\u00e9szet\nFerment\u00c1lom\nEz\u00fcst kecske\nIll\u00e9s Kamra\nOLIVA AGORA\nGy\u00fcm\u00f6lcs Liget\n@HERR K\u00c4SE94\nErika Maro \u0151stermel\u0151, vecs\u00e9si savany\u00fas\u00e1gok\nPistacia Vera\nENB\u00c9 kozmetikumok\nZ\u00f6ldf\u0171z \u2014 Horv\u00e1th Kata\nForr\u00e1s: Kacsak\u0151 Bisztr\u00f3","format":"plain_text"}],"field_program_end":[{"value":"2026-09-06T13:00:00"}],"field_program_family":[{"value":"0"}],"field_program_image":[{"uri":"https:\/\/programok.szentendre.hu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/768310471_1575483787562098_3251925215249798197_n.jpg","title":"","options":[]}],"field_program_last_seen":[{"value":"2026-08-31T18:18:03"}],"field_program_place":[{"target_id":"1185"}],"field_program_price":[],"field_program_source_updated":[{"value":"2026-08-31T07:51:37"}],"field_program_start":[{"value":"2026-09-06T08:00:00"}],"field_program_status":[{"value":"scheduled"}],"field_program_ticket":[],"field_source_name":[{"value":"Szentendrei Programkeres\u0151"}],"field_source_url":[{"uri":"https:\/\/programok.szentendre.hu\/esemeny\/kacsako-piac\/","title":null,"options":[]}]},{"nid":[{"value":"1192"}],"uuid":[{"value":"9438f196-8877-403c-8e5c-c00186c5f782"}],"vid":[{"value":"1852"}],"langcode":[{"value":"hu"}],"type":[{"target_id":"cultural_program"}],"revision_timestamp":[{"value":"1788200233"}],"revision_uid":[{"target_id":"0"}],"revision_log":[{"value":"Eredeti programk\u00e9p URL-je friss\u00edtve a forr\u00e1soldalr\u00f3l."}],"status":[{"value":"1"}],"uid":[{"target_id":"0"}],"title":[{"value":"Arcfest\u00e9s \u00e9s henna Kov\u00e1cs \u00c1got\u00e1val"}],"created":[{"v