00e9rd\u00e9sekre keress\u00fck a v\u00e1laszt. Megn\u00e9zz\u00fck, milyen arcai vannak az okos n\u0151nek, \u00e9s vajon mi a k\u00fcl\u00f6nbs\u00e9g a ki\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s h\u0151se, Fialka Olga \u00e9s a mesei h\u0151sn\u0151 \u00e9lete, d\u00f6nt\u00e9sei \u00e9s m\u0171k\u00f6d\u00e9se k\u00f6z\u00f6tt.\nA n\u00e9pmes\u00e9vel \u00e9s Fialka Olga portr\u00e9inak, v\u00e1zlatk\u00f6nyve k\u00fcl\u00f6n\u00f6s kincseivel val\u00f3 munka nemcsak a m\u0171v\u00e9szn\u0151 el\u0151tti tisztelg\u00e9s. Kapcsol\u00f3d\u00e1si lehet\u0151s\u00e9g is a benn\u00fcnk \u00e9l\u0151 \u201et\u00f6k\u00e9letes t\u00e1rshoz\u201d: ahhoz a n\u0151i min\u0151s\u00e9ghez, amely figyelemmel, lelem\u00e9nnyel, t\u00fcrelemmel \u00e9s tud\u00e1ssal k\u00e9pes alak\u00edtani saj\u00e1t vil\u00e1g\u00e1t.\nVajon mit \u0151rizt\u00fcnk meg magunkban az okos l\u00e1nyb\u00f3l?\nA sz\u00f6veg Boldizs\u00e1r Ildik\u00f3 gondolatai nyom\u00e1n sz\u00fcletett.\nB\u0151vebben a ki\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sr\u00f3l","format":"plain_text"}],"field_program_end":[{"value":"2026-10-24T15:30:00"}],"field_program_family":[{"value":"0"}],"field_program_image":[{"uri":"https:\/\/femuz.hu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/5R4A0023-scaled.jpg","title":"","options":[]}],"field_program_last_seen":[{"value":"2026-08-31T18:18:03"}],"field_program_place":[{"target_id":"1167"}],"field_program_price":[],"field_program_source_updated":[{"value":"2026-08-31T10:55:43"}],"field_program_start":[{"value":"2026-10-24T14:00:00"}],"field_program_status":[{"value":"scheduled"}],"field_program_ticket":[],"field_source_name":[{"value":"Ferenczy M\u00fazeumi Centrum"}],"field_source_url":[{"uri":"https:\/\/femuz.hu\/esemeny\/muzeumi-mesek-tokeletes-tars\/","title":null,"options":[]}]},{"nid":[{"value":"1235"}],"uuid":[{"value":"88a69d9c-a2a2-42c6-a325-421f54ed3a6d"}],"vid":[{"value":"1885"}],"langcode":[{"value":"hu"}],"type":[{"target_id":"cultural_program"}],"revision_timestamp":[{"value":"1788200233"}],"revision_uid":[